OL,3,GNEWSADouble jeopardy killer recommended
OL,4,Afor release from prison                
OL,6,FA murderer who became the first person 
OL,7,Ftried after a change to the            
OL,8,F800-year-old double jeopardy law has   
OL,9,Fbeen recommended for release from      
OL,10,Fprison.                                
OL,12,FWilliam Dunlop, now 63, strangled Julie
OL,13,FHogg, 22, in Billingham, County Durham,
OL,14,Fin 1989 and hid her mutilated body     
OL,15,Fbehind a bath panel which was          
OL,16,Fdiscovered by her mother more than two 
OL,17,Fmonths later.                          
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
