OL,3,GNEWSADouble jeopardy killer recommended
OL,4,Afor release from prison                
OL,6,FThe Parole Board has recommended he be 
OL,7,Freleased after his fourth application  
OL,8,Fto review his case. A panel had        
OL,9,Frecommended Dunlop's transfer to open  
OL,10,Fprison multiple times but three justice
OL,11,Fsecretaries had intervened.            
OL,13,FJustice Secretary Alex Norris has asked
OL,14,Fofficials "to examine whether there are
OL,15,Fgrounds to reconsider" the Parole      
OL,16,FBoard's decision.                      
